              "line": 84,
              "message": "`infrastructure::AgentProfilesCapabilityAdapter` is declared `modify`, but the frozen rustdoc baseline already has the same private-field struct shape and the identical `new(PathBuf, PathBuf) -> Self` signature. Only existing port-method behavior is planned to change, so this TypeEntry does not describe a structural modification and is already blue before that work occurs. Declare the baseline-identical type/impl identity as `reference`.",
