            {
              "category": "state-shape smell",
              "file": "track/items/2026-08-13-multi-provider-capability-routing/usecase-types.json",
              "line": 277,
              "message": "`usecase::CapabilityProfile` exposes `provider: ProviderName` and `model_provider: Option<ModelProviderName>` as independent public fields. This permits `model_provider: Some(...)` with a non-Codex provider, even though AC-02 requires profiles using `model_provider` to retain `provider = codex`. No constructor or enum enforces that relationship, so an invalid routing state is representable; encode the binding as a validated composite/enum or use private fields with a validating constructor.",
              "severity": "P1"
            }
          ],
